<p>Someone attempted to link <%= @identity_provider %> login to your account using your email address.</p>

<p>If this was you, confirm here to grant <%= @identity_provider %> sign-in access to your account:</p>
<p><a href="<%= @confirmation_url %>">Confirm identity link</a></p>

<p>If you did not initiate this, ignore this email. Nothing has changed.</p>
